# Goal
string object_name        # MuJoCo body to pick (empty -> server parameter object_body)
float64 place_x           # place target in MuJoCo world frame (m)
float64 place_y
---
# Result
bool success              # object ended within success_tolerance of the target
float64 final_distance    # horizontal object-to-target distance (m)
geometry_msgs/Pose final_object_pose
string message
---
# Feedback
string stage              # approach | descend | grasp | lift | place | open | retreat
